o de la tripulación 'expendable' (prescindible) enviado a un planeta helado para colonizarlo, se niega a dejar que su clon de reemplazo, Mickey 18, tome su lugar... Adaptación del libro original de Edward Ashton.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Comedia","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/696506","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:08:11.383Z"},{"id":"movie-1393326","slug":"movie-1393326","title":"Ghost in the Cell","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gF6Ijrq5bixh4qemCuroRwXtbBc.jpg","synopsis":"En una conocida prisión, una fuerza invisible comienza a matar brutalmente a los reclusos, obligando a las bandas enemigas y a los guardias corruptos a trabajar juntos mientras intentan sobrevivir al creciente derramamiento de sangre.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Comedia","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1393326","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:08:11.659Z"},{"id":"movie-1541560","slug":"movie-1541560","title":"Stop! That! Train!","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wPvh5kZyn1yQVq6Nqhio27JZ8Hc.jpg","synopsis":"Dos amigas azafatas de tren cambian un aburrido ferrocarril por el lujoso Glamazonian Express. Durante una gran tormenta, deben trabajar con la estirada tripulación de primera clase y el presidente Gagwell para evitar un desastre en Los Ángeles.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1541560","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:08:11.934Z"},{"id":"movie-1284016","slug":"movie-1284016","title":"Letras robadas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oYqsgYCaPjCvd3NPE43yNbhgCtG.jpg","synopsis":"Rick, un cantante de bodas venido a menos, y Danny, una estrella de una 'boy band' en decadencia, forjan una amistad gracia