-36647","slug":"movie-36647","title":"Blade","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dCsTsFX4PT9wewpKYaddwPHYI3A.jpg","synopsis":"En un mundo cohabitado en guerra por hombres y vampiros Blade es un vampiro que, al contrario que el resto, no se alimenta de humanos, y que pretende acabar con la raza de \"seres superiores\" que mordieron a su madre cuando estaba embarazada.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/36647","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1998,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:43.644Z"},{"id":"movie-49521","slug":"movie-49521","title":"El hombre de acero","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5JW44QGgpEWx4aWXM0uVSi2xtrI.jpg","synopsis":"Un niño descubre que posee poderes extraordinarios y que no pertenece a este planeta. En su juventud, viaja para descubrir sus orígenes y las razones por las cuales ha sido enviado a la Tierra. Pero el héroe que lleva dentro tiene que emerger para que pueda salvar al mundo de la aniquilación y convertirse en el símbolo de esperanza para la humanidad.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/49521","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2013,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:43.917Z"},{"id":"movie-1549709","slug":"movie-1549709","title":"พี่นาค 5","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mGQBm9azvEO3cOQuZPhmH0QZiOb.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1549709","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:16:44.198Z"},{"id":"movie-1596318","slug":"movie-1596318","title":"Cookie Queens","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3OgOZ7TAV2sbn6J0yDAR4itAY6r.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net