ture","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":24,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/226749-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:23:44.281Z"},{"id":"tv-114922","slug":"tv-114922","title":"Citadel","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5MHtxPEfmN4b0rHzfEZRcm6v9WI.jpg","synopsis":"Hace ocho años, Citadel, agencia de espionaje global e independiente, fue destruida por una nueva organización, Manticore. Con la memoria borrada, los agentes de élite Mason Kane y Nadia Sinh se salvaron por poco. Ocho años después, el excolega de Mason, Bernard Orlick, le pide ayuda para evitar que Manticore imponga un nuevo orden mundial.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen","Action & Adventure"],"totalEpisodes":13,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/114922-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:23:44.557Z"},{"id":"tv-332713","slug":"tv-332713","title":"南田南弁護士は天才肌","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ax4KpZOjZ59hp6IjYNOfJMAYge0.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":10,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/332713-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:23:44.836Z"},{"id":"tv-312233","slug":"tv-312233","title":"แหวนรักข้ามเวลา","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vq1eB1DRfaIrin3b5HVy3nvM2mD.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":1,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/312233-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:23:45.135Z"},{"id":"tv-303351","slug":"tv-303351","title":"Sacrificio de sangre","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/whKEwZcYVM0kzKHsS8LtS5SyD1c.jpg","synopsis":"Tras el brutal asesinato de dos agentes de policía, un tenaz inspector se ve obligado a trabajar con su padre, un expolicía al que hace tiempo que no ve, para atrapar al asesino.","status":"En 