a wa Yuri no Hana","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/se1dHUNQMRwUt75xRqkQRmXJicg.jpg","synopsis":"Botan, una universitaria de 20 años, se emborracha en la fiesta del dormitorio y termina involucrándose con Ibuki, su burlona líder. ¡Una divertida comedia de enredos!","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":12,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/283905-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:07.210Z"},{"id":"tv-198102","slug":"tv-198102","title":"Hijack","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vAo3QL02oOI9Xz90FILQN5vxMsQ.jpg","synopsis":"El negociador Sam Nelson va a vivir el viaje de su vida cuando un grupo de secuestradores toma el control. Sam agotará sus tácticas, pero la situación es límite.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":15,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/198102-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:07.485Z"},{"id":"tv-330302","slug":"tv-330302","title":"Catedrales","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7LQKFR1iOlIZkbDLbhcLOBWfmXk.jpg","synopsis":"Una joven de 17 años es hallada quemada y descuartizada en un baldío de un barrio de clase media de Santiago de Chile. Por impericia policial el crimen queda impune hasta que treinta años más tarde la familia consigue organizar el rompecabezas del asesinato que les revela una relación prohibida y una cruel verdad.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":6,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/330302-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:07.760Z"},{"id":"tv-279603","slug":"tv-279603","title":"Patience","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kJAKX5QVCbQYxrdlq0jFUA45zuj.jpg","synopsis":"Una archivista autista con talento, se adentra en un mundo impredecible cuando la detective Bea descubre sus singulares habilidades para resolver crímenes.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":14,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/279603-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:08.044Z"},{"id":"tv-1999","slug":"tv-1999","title":"The Comeback","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nFZF0ljINGUEa0wAW5d22Iqxjii.jpg","synopsis":"Valerie Cherish es una actriz de telecomedias de segunda tan desesperada por relanzar su carrera que acepta protagonizar el reality \"The Comeback\".","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":29,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1999-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2005,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:08.317Z"},{"id":"tv-1126","slug":"tv-1126","title":"Happy Tree Friends","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2rYqJg1OzaDlc5kiBK4IdgrELMf.jpg","synopsis":"Únete a estos lindos y dulces bichos mientras hacen un picnic en los árboles, se divierten felices en el bosque, pisan trampas para osos y entran en los caminos de los coches con exceso de velocidad. Así que únete a todos tus animales peludos favoritos, sus grandes aventuras y accidentes y desmembramientos gráficamente horribles, ¡y no olvides lavarte las manos primero!","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":180,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1126-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2000,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:24:08.596Z"}],"seasons":[{"id":"movie-1148365-1","slug":"movie-1148365-1","seriesId":"movie-1148365","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1148365","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ev2GnYar3LUyui8sOu4gqeMXvLi.jpg","episodeCount":1,"initialSyncComplete":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-14T12:07:29.641Z"},{"id":"movie-1400837-1","slug":"movie-1400837-1","seriesId":"movie-1400837","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1400837","number":1,"image":"https:/